# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn which time-based usage fields in the IBM Quantum Compute API to disregard, and which resource unit (RU) fields replace them."
msgstr "Alamin kung aling mga time-based na usage field sa IBM Quantum Compute API ang dapat balewalain, at kung aling mga resource unit (RU) field ang pumapalit sa mga ito."

# sync db1f9e358: restore headings the sync reverted to English
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate to resource units (RUs) in the IBM Quantum Compute API"
msgstr "Lumipat sa resource units (RUs) sa IBM Quantum Compute API"

# sync db1f9e358: restore headings the sync reverted to English
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate to resource units (RUs) in the IBM Quantum Compute API {#migrate-to-resource-units-rus-in-the-ibm-quantum-compute-api}"
msgstr "Lumipat sa resource units (RUs) sa IBM Quantum Compute API {#migrate-to-resource-units-rus-in-the-ibm-quantum-compute-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum&reg; Platform now measures usage in resource units (RUs). An RU is the unit that IBM Quantum uses to measure and bill the usage of all workloads. Before this change, the platform measured usage as QPU time in seconds or milliseconds. For more information about RUs, see [Resource units](/guides/plans-overview#resource-units).\n"
msgstr "Sinusukat na ngayon ng IBM Quantum&reg; Platform ang paggamit sa resource units (RUs). Ang RU ay ang unit na ginagamit ng IBM Quantum para sukatin at singilin ang paggamit ng lahat ng workload. Bago ang pagbabagong ito, sinusukat ng platform ang paggamit bilang QPU time sa segundo o millisecond. Para sa higit pang impormasyon tungkol sa mga RU, tingnan ang [Resource units](/guides/plans-overview#resource-units).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today, the API returns two sets of fields: the old time fields and the new RU fields. Your integration continues to work. In a future release, IBM Quantum will remove the time fields. Change your integration to read the RU fields now.\n"
msgstr "Sa ngayon, nagbabalik ang API ng dalawang set ng field: ang mga lumang time field at ang mga bagong RU field. Patuloy na gagana ang integration mo. Sa susunod na release, aalisin ng IBM Quantum ang mga time field. Palitan na ngayon ang integration mo para basahin ang mga RU field.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide uses these terms:\n"
msgstr "Ginagamit ng gabay na ito ang mga sumusunod na termino:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Workload**: A job, a session, a batch, or a function run.\n"
msgstr "**Workload**: Isang job, isang session, isang batch, o isang pagpapatakbo ng function.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QPU workload**: A job, a session, or a batch. A QPU workload runs only on a QPU.\n"
msgstr "**QPU workload**: Isang job, isang session, o isang batch. Ang QPU workload ay tumatakbo lamang sa isang QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Function workload**: A function run. A function workload can use classical compute and an execution license, and it can also use a QPU.\n"
msgstr "**Function workload**: Isang pagpapatakbo ng function. Ang function workload ay maaaring gumamit ng classical compute at execution license, at maaari rin itong gumamit ng QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Session**: A group of jobs that run together on one QPU.\n"
msgstr "**Session**: Isang grupo ng mga job na sabay na tumatakbo sa isang QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance**: A service instance. It owns workloads and has usage limits.\n"
msgstr "**Instance**: Isang service instance. Ito ang may-ari ng mga workload at may mga limitasyon sa paggamit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Plan**: The service plan of an account. It sets the usage limits for all instances in the account.\n"
msgstr "**Plan**: Ang service plan ng isang account. Itinatakda nito ang mga limitasyon sa paggamit para sa lahat ng instance sa account.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  This guide uses version 0.57.2 of the [OpenAPI spec](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/openapi.json).\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  Ginagamit ng gabay na ito ang bersyon 0.57.2 ng [OpenAPI spec](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/openapi.json).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The `IBM-API-Version` header value must be `2026-04-15` or a later supported API version.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Ang value ng header na `IBM-API-Version` ay dapat `2026-04-15` o isang mas bagong suportadong bersyon ng API.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary {#summary}"
msgstr "Buod {#summary}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Endpoint | Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Create, update, and read service instances | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Each usage field in milliseconds | The matching field with the `_ru` suffix |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Endpoint | Balewalain | Basahin na lang |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Gumawa, mag-update, at magbasa ng mga service instance | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Bawat usage field sa millisecond | Ang katumbas na field na may suffix na `_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sections that follow give the details for each endpoint.\n"
msgstr "Ibinibigay ng mga sumusunod na seksyon ang mga detalye para sa bawat endpoint.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jobs {#jobs}"
msgstr "Mga Job {#jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/jobs` and `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"
msgstr "Mga endpoint: `GET /v1/jobs` at `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Balewalain | Basahin na lang |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `usage` object also has these fields:\n"
msgstr "Ang object na `usage` ay mayroon ding mga sumusunod na field:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.unit`: The unit of `usage.value`. The value is always `\"resource_units\"`.\n"
msgstr "`usage.unit`: Ang unit ng `usage.value`. Palaging `\"resource_units\"` ang value.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.status`: The billing status. The value is `\"pending\"` or `\"complete\"`. If the status is `\"pending\"`, the platform can still change the value. Do not use a pending value as the final usage.\n"
msgstr "`usage.status`: Ang billing status. Ang value ay `\"pending\"` o `\"complete\"`. Kung `\"pending\"` ang status, maaari pang baguhin ng platform ang value. Huwag gamitin ang pending na value bilang pinal na paggamit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[]`: The usage for each billing metric. The `value` of each entry is in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[]`: Ang paggamit para sa bawat billing metric. Ang `value` ng bawat entry ay nasa RUs.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Example:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The field `usage.details[].metric.value` is not the usage in RUs. It is the quantity of the metric that the platform used to calculate the RUs. Each metric has its own unit. For example, the unit of a QPU metric is seconds. For the usage, read `usage.details[].value`.\n"
msgstr "Ang field na `usage.details[].metric.value` ay hindi ang paggamit sa RUs. Ito ang dami ng metric na ginamit ng platform para kalkulahin ang mga RU. May sariling unit ang bawat metric. Halimbawa, segundo ang unit ng isang QPU metric. Para sa paggamit, basahin ang `usage.details[].value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workloads {#workloads}"
msgstr "Mga Workload {#workloads}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `workloads[]` has a `usage` object. This object has the same fields as the `usage` object of a job.\n"
msgstr "Ang bawat item sa `workloads[]` ay may object na `usage`. Ang object na ito ay may parehong mga field gaya ng object na `usage` ng isang job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Balewalain | Basahin na lang |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a workload is still running, `usage` is `null`.\n"
msgstr "Kung tumatakbo pa ang isang workload, `null` ang `usage`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function workloads {#function-workloads}"
msgstr "Mga function workload {#function-workloads}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The usage of a function workload is in RUs, the same as for a QPU workload. A function workload can use more than one metric:\n"
msgstr "Ang paggamit ng isang function workload ay nasa RUs, gaya ng sa QPU workload. Ang isang function workload ay maaaring gumamit ng higit sa isang metric:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QPU usage.** This is metered per second of quantum time. See [Execution modes](/guides/execution-modes).\n"
msgstr "**Paggamit ng QPU.** Sinusukat ito bawat segundo ng quantum time. Tingnan ang [Execution modes](/guides/execution-modes).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Classical compute usage.** This is metered per second of [classical time](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
msgstr "**Paggamit ng classical compute.** Sinusukat ito bawat segundo ng [classical time](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Execution license cost.** This is metered per workload, based on the [size of the problem passed to a function](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"
msgstr "**Gastos ng execution license.** Sinusukat ito bawat workload, batay sa [laki ng problemang ipinasa sa isang function](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The platform converts the quantity of each metric to RUs. Thus, all usage values are in RUs:\n"
msgstr "Kino-convert ng platform ang dami ng bawat metric sa RUs. Kaya, lahat ng usage value ay nasa RUs:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.value` is the usage of the workload, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "Ang `usage.value` ay ang paggamit ng workload, sa RUs.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].value` is the usage for one metric, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "Ang `usage.details[].value` ay ang paggamit para sa isang metric, sa RUs.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].metric.value` is the quantity of the metric, in the unit of that metric. It is not in RUs.\n"
msgstr "Ang `usage.details[].metric.value` ay ang dami ng metric, sa unit ng metric na iyon. Hindi ito nasa RUs.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you show or add usage values, use `usage.value` and `usage.details[].value`. Do not use `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"
msgstr "Kung magpapakita o magdadagdag ka ng mga usage value, gamitin ang `usage.value` at `usage.details[].value`. Huwag gamitin ang `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sessions {#sessions}"
msgstr "Mga Session {#sessions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `POST /v1/sessions` and `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Mga endpoint: `POST /v1/sessions` at `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (seconds) | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Balewalain | Basahin na lang |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (segundo) | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The session `usage` object has `unit` and `details[]`. These fields work the same as in the job `usage` object, with the exception of the `status` field, which is omitted for sessions.\n"
msgstr "Ang object na `usage` ng session ay may `unit` at `details[]`. Gumagana ang mga field na ito gaya ng sa object na `usage` ng job, maliban sa field na `status`, na wala sa mga session.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` do not change. They are time limits (TTL means \"time to live\"), not usage. Their unit stays seconds.\n"
msgstr "Hindi nagbabago ang mga field na `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, at `active_ttl`. Mga time limit ang mga ito (ang TTL ay nangangahulugang \"time to live\"), hindi paggamit. Nananatiling segundo ang unit nila.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance usage {#instance-usage}"
msgstr "Paggamit ng instance {#instance-usage}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Balewalain | Basahin na lang |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period`, and `time_available_at` do not change.\n"
msgstr "Hindi nagbabago ang mga field na `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period`, at `time_available_at`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Account plans {#account-plans}"
msgstr "Mga plan ng account {#account-plans}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `plans[]` has these changes:\n"
msgstr "Ang bawat item sa `plans[]` ay may mga sumusunod na pagbabago:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Balewalain | Basahin na lang |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Service instances in the Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"
msgstr "Mga service instance sa Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API is a separate API. You use it to create and update service instances. If you create or update instances with this API, change the instance parameters too.\n"
msgstr "Ang IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API ay isang hiwalay na API. Ginagamit mo ito para gumawa at mag-update ng mga service instance. Kung gumagawa o nag-a-update ka ng mga instance gamit ang API na ito, palitan mo rin ang mga parameter ng instance.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create or update an instance, send these parameters in the request:\n"
msgstr "Kapag gumawa o nag-update ka ng instance, ipadala ang mga sumusunod na parameter sa request:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Don't send | Send instead | Type of the new parameter |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Huwag ipadala | Ipadala na lang | Uri ng bagong parameter |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number o `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number o `null` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parameters have these meanings:\n"
msgstr "Ito ang kahulugan ng mga parameter:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance limit**The maximum usage for the instance. If you do not send a limit on the Open Plan, the default is the RU equivalent of 10 minutes.\n"
msgstr "**Instance limit**Ang pinakamataas na paggamit para sa instance. Kung hindi ka magpapadala ng limitasyon sa Open Plan, ang default ay ang katumbas na RU ng 10 minuto.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage allocation**: The share of usage for the instance. The fair-share scheduler uses this value to set the priority of the instance in the queue. The allocation does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "**Usage allocation**: Ang bahagi ng paggamit para sa instance. Ginagamit ng fair-share scheduler ang value na ito para itakda ang priyoridad ng instance sa pila. Hindi nalalapat ang allocation sa mga Pay-As-You-Go na instance.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you read an instance, the `extensions` object in the response contains the old fields and the new fields. Disregard `instance_limit_seconds` and `usage_allocation_seconds`. Read `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"
msgstr "Kapag nagbasa ka ng instance, ang object na `extensions` sa response ay naglalaman ng mga lumang field at mga bagong field. Balewalain ang `instance_limit_seconds` at `usage_allocation_seconds`. Basahin ang `instance_limit_ru` at `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"
msgstr "Para sa higit pang impormasyon, tingnan ang [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"

# sync db1f9e358: restore headings the sync reverted to English
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage analytics {#usage-analytics}"
msgstr "Analytics ng paggamit {#usage-analytics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, and `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"
msgstr "Mga endpoint: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, at `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The three endpoints have the same usage fields. The two grouped endpoints return these fields for each group or each date.\n"
msgstr "Pareho ang mga usage field ng tatlong endpoint. Ibinabalik ng dalawang grouped na endpoint ang mga field na ito para sa bawat grupo o bawat petsa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The old analytics usage fields are in milliseconds, not seconds.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga lumang analytics usage field ay nasa millisecond, hindi segundo.\n"

