# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These function fields are new. They have no old field in milliseconds:\n"
msgstr "Bago ang mga function field na ito. Wala silang lumang field sa millisecond:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`functions_usage_ru`\n"
msgstr "`functions_usage_ru`\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`avg_functions_usage_ru`\n"
msgstr "`avg_functions_usage_ru`\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_functions_usage_ru`\n"
msgstr "`max_functions_usage_ru`\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`functions_classical_usage_ru`\n"
msgstr "`functions_classical_usage_ru`\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`functions_license_cost_ru`\n"
msgstr "`functions_license_cost_ru`\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The total in `usage_ru` includes more than the total in `usage`:\n"
msgstr "Mas marami ang kasama sa kabuuan sa `usage_ru` kaysa sa kabuuan sa `usage`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage` is the sum of QPU time for sessions, individual jobs, and functions.\n"
msgstr "Ang `usage` ay ang kabuuan ng QPU time para sa mga session, individual job, at function.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_ru` is the sum of usage for sessions, individual jobs, and functions. For functions, it also includes classical compute and license cost.\n"
msgstr "Ang `usage_ru` ay ang kabuuan ng paggamit para sa mga session, individual job, at function. Para sa mga function, kasama rin dito ang classical compute at gastos ng license.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, `usage_ru` is not only `usage` in a different unit.\n"
msgstr "Kaya, ang `usage_ru` ay hindi lang basta `usage` sa ibang unit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, and `max_queue_time` do not change. They measure wait time, not usage. Their unit stays milliseconds.\n"
msgstr "Hindi nagbabago ang mga field na `queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, at `max_queue_time`. Sinusukat nila ang oras ng paghihintay, hindi paggamit. Nananatiling millisecond ang unit nila.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields that do not change {#fields-that-do-not-change}"
msgstr "Mga field na hindi nagbabago {#fields-that-do-not-change}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These fields contain time values, but they do not measure usage. IBM Quantum does not plan to replace them:\n"
msgstr "Naglalaman ang mga field na ito ng mga time value, pero hindi sila sumusukat ng paggamit. Walang planong palitan ang mga ito ng IBM Quantum:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`wait_time_seconds` on backends: The estimated wait in the queue.\n"
msgstr "`wait_time_seconds` sa mga backend: Ang tinatayang paghihintay sa pila.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`circuits_execution_time_ns` in `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`: The time that the job ran on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "`circuits_execution_time_ns` sa `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`: Ang oras na tumakbo ang job sa QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` on sessions.\n"
msgstr "`interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, at `active_ttl` sa mga session.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, and `max_queue_time` in analytics.\n"
msgstr "`queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, at `max_queue_time` sa analytics.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`rep_times` and `circuit_duration` in backend configuration.\n"
msgstr "`rep_times` at `circuit_duration` sa backend configuration.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration steps {#migration-steps}"
msgstr "Mga hakbang sa migration {#migration-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find each old field in your code. Search for `qpu_charge_time_seconds`, `elapsed_time`, the `_seconds` fields in this guide, and the analytics fields in milliseconds.\n"
msgstr "Hanapin ang bawat lumang field sa code mo. Hanapin ang `qpu_charge_time_seconds`, `elapsed_time`, ang mga field na `_seconds` sa gabay na ito, at ang mga analytics field sa millisecond.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change each old field to the RU field in the tables of this guide.\n"
msgstr "Palitan ang bawat lumang field ng RU field na nasa mga talahanayan ng gabay na ito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you create or update service instances with the Resource Controller API, send `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`. Do not send the `_seconds` parameters.\n"
msgstr "Kung gumagawa o nag-a-update ka ng mga service instance gamit ang Resource Controller API, ipadala ang `instance_limit_ru` at `usage_allocation_ru`. Huwag ipadala ang mga parameter na `_seconds`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change the labels in your user interface. Show \"RU\" or \"resource units\", not \"seconds\" or \"minutes\". Do not convert RUs to time. There is no fixed rate between RUs and time.\n"
msgstr "Palitan ang mga label sa user interface mo. Ipakita ang \"RU\" o \"resource units\", hindi \"segundo\" o \"minuto\". Huwag i-convert ang mga RU sa oras. Walang takdang rate sa pagitan ng mga RU at oras.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you read `usage.details[]`, use `value` for the usage in RUs. Do not use `metric.value`, because its unit is the unit of the metric.\n"
msgstr "Kung binabasa mo ang `usage.details[]`, gamitin ang `value` para sa paggamit sa RUs. Huwag gamitin ang `metric.value`, dahil ang unit nito ay ang unit ng metric.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If `usage.status` is `\"pending\"`, show the value as provisional.\n"
msgstr "Kung `\"pending\"` ang `usage.status`, ipakita ang value bilang pansamantala.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If an RU field is missing or `null`, use the same logic that you use for the old field today.\n"
msgstr "Kung nawawala o `null` ang isang RU field, gamitin ang parehong logic na ginagamit mo ngayon para sa lumang field.\n"
